OL,3,GNEWSAA&E waits unacceptable, say
OL,4,Ahospital bosses
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior officials at Addenbrooke's
OL,7,FHospital have said too many patients
OL,8,Fare waiting for too long in its
OL,9,Faccident and emergency department.
OL,11,FCambridge University Hospitals NHS
OL,12,FFoundation Trust board papers said the
OL,13,Fdelays were "not acceptable". It said
OL,14,Fthe hospital was facing a shortage of
OL,15,Fbeds and that there were staffing
OL,16,Fissues in several departments.
OL,18,F"The trust continues to take [urgent
OL,19,Fcare performance] seriously and is
OL,20,Ffocused on the pace of recovery," the
OL,21,Fhospital's executive team wrote in a
OL,22,Freport.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
